  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The professional ethics hearing concerning former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo has been officially postponed until next week after the subject declined to attend the initial proceedings at Mabes Polri. The inquiry pertains to allegations involving the wiretapping of the president. Representatives for the police force indicated that they lack the authority to forcibly compel an individual's appearance at such ethics tribunals. However, legal experts and observers have highlighted that continued failure to appear could result in the loss of rights to mount a formal defense or file an appeal in the matter. The delay has prompted discussions regarding the procedural rules of the National Police Code of Ethics Commission, with officials emphasizing that there is no special treatment regarding these regulations. This development follows intense public and media scrutiny surrounding the allegations and the subsequent internal investigation process.",
